          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waire ng'abalasi b'obusaale Abakedari n'abasinga okuba abalwani ab'amaani, aye abalisigalagho baliba batono. Nze Musengwa Katonda wa Isiraeli, ntyo bwe nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
